          "first": {
            "seq": 9,
            "text": "Translate a batch of Chinese UI strings from a DeepSeek Harness plugin (\"Dsh Whale Balance Widget\" — a whale-girl character widget showing API balance) into fluent English.\n\nINPUT FILE (read ONLY your assigned line range):\nC:\\Users\\hoang\\OneDrive\\Documents\\deepseek-harness\\default-workspace\\whale-list.tsv\n\nRead lines 241–480 inclusive (use the read tool with offset=241, limit=240).\n\nFormat of each line is TAB-separated:\n  <index>\\t<occurrence count>\\t<which files>\\t<JSON-encoded Chinese string>\n\nOUTPUT FILE (create exactly this):\nC:\\Users\\hoang\\OneDrive\\Documents\\deepseek-harness\\default-workspace\\xlate-2.json\n\nWrite a JSON object mapping each ORIGINAL Chinese string (exact, as it appears inside the JSON quotes on the line, unescaped to the real characters) to its English translation:\n{\n  \"取消\": \"Cancel\",\n  ...\n}\n\nCRITICAL RULES — these strings are substituted back into a live JavaScript bundle, so:\n\n1. **Preserve every placeholder token EXACTLY and in place**: `{cost}`, `{balance}`, `{today}`, `{quota}`, `{quota_used}`, `{quota_left}`, `{quota_total}`, `{quota_reset}`, `{expense_ds}`, `{balance_ds}`, `{bonus_ds}`, `{recharge_ds}`, `{session}`, `{status}`, `{countdown}`, `{plan}`, `{plan_left}`, `{plan_reset}`, `{amount}`, `{below}`, `{modelName}`, `{model}` etc. Never translate or reorder them.\n\n2. **Some strings are HTML fragments and MUST stay valid HTML.** Keep every tag, attribute, `style=` value, `class=`, and entity (`&amp;`, `&lt;`) byte-identical — translate only the visible human text between tags.\n\n3. **Many entries are FRAGMENTS concatenated with other text or numbers at runtime.** Translate them so they read naturally in English when joined, and keep leading/trailing spaces and punctuation exactly. Examples:\n   - `\" · 今日 \"` → `\" · Today \"` (keeps surrounding spaces and the middle dot)\n   - `\" 个模块\"` → `\" modules\"`\n   - `\" 元\"` → `\" CNY\"`\n   - `\" · 余额未刷新\"` → `\" · balance not refreshed\"`\n\n4. **Whale-girl personality lines** (the character's random speech bubbles) must keep their playful, sassy, meme-y tone. Do NOT sanitize them into corporate English — match the original's humour. `喵` is a cat-noise particle: render as a playful \"meow\" or drop it if it reads badly.\n\n5. **Keep product/company names as-is** where they are proper nouns: DeepSeek, Codex, GPT image 2, New API, Ollama, Claude, Kimi, GLM, StepFun, Ark, OpenCode Go, Minecraft. Chinese vendor names use the official English name (硅基流动 → SiliconFlow, 火山方舟 → Volcano Ark, 智谱 → Zhipu, 腾讯混元 → Tencent Hunyuan, 讯飞星火 → iFlytek Spark, 百度千帆 → Baidu Qianfan, 阿里云百炼 → Alibaba Cloud Model Studio, 阶跃星辰 → StepFun).\n\n6. **Do not translate** strings that are pure numbers/symbols/emoji; copy them through unchanged.\n\n7. Every key you emit MUST be copied exactly from the input (same characters, same spaces). A single mismatched character means the substitution silently fails.\n\nWORKFLOW:\n- Read your assigned lines.\n- Produce the JSON for exactly those entries (do not add or omit any).\n- Write the output file.\n- Report: number of entries written, and any entry you were unsure about.\nYour parent agent id is \"session-5f849a2d-cf55-4d27-9f63-051eb23432de\". Before you finish, send your result to that agent with send_message({ agent_id: \"session-5f849a2d-cf55-4d27-9f63-051eb23432de\", message: \"<self-contained result>\" }). The parent shares your workspace but does not automatically receive your transcript, tool output, or reasoning. Send earlier messages as well when a finding changes what the parent should do next; sending a message does not end your turn."
          },
